    LLM: 'Game: Asso Pigliatutto. Type: Fishing (Scopa). Variant: Ace takes all. Deck: 40-Card Italian. Goals: Capture Settebello, Primiera, Coins, Most Cards. Ace Sweep = No Point (Standard).',
    Player: "Welcome to Asso Pigliatutto. It's like Scopa, but with a twist: playing an Ace captures EVERYTHING on the table! Try to capture the 7 of Coins (Settebello) and the most Coins to win.",
